== static mutation checks ==
These do not run the CPU. They prove the artifact checker catches bad generated files.
Each case starts from a freshly signed temp copy so stale repo artifacts do not hide the specific failure.

-- manifest magic byte changed --
patched flash_image.bin at 0x00000000: 0x53 -> 0xac
PASS: artifact checker rejected bad case: manifest magic byte changed
FAIL: flash manifest region matches metadata/manifest.bin
SUMMARY: 1 artifact check(s) failed

-- public key byte changed in flash --
patched flash_image.bin at 0x000000a5: 0x70 -> 0x8f
PASS: artifact checker rejected bad case: public key byte changed in flash
FAIL: flash public key region matches metadata/public_key.bin
SUMMARY: 1 artifact check(s) failed

-- kernel byte changed in flash --
patched flash_image.bin at 0x000000c0: 0x81 -> 0x7e
PASS: artifact checker rejected bad case: kernel byte changed in flash
FAIL: flash kernel region matches software/kernel/kernel.bin
SUMMARY: 1 artifact check(s) failed

-- manifest payload_size changed without rebuilding flash/signature --
patched manifest.payload_size: 7896 / 0x1ed8 -> 0 / 0x0
PASS: artifact checker rejected bad case: manifest payload_size changed without rebuilding flash/signature
FAIL: manifest payload_size matches kernel.bin size
FAIL: flash manifest region matches metadata/manifest.bin
SUMMARY: 2 artifact check(s) failed
